n strategically direct flow thereof.  Everyone else is necessarily subservient to these masterminds, identity of whom is no secret, easily verified.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;And it&amp;#39;s true as u somewhat indicate, &amp;quot;anon,&amp;quot; these topmost COUNTERFEIT conspirators must indubitably have accomplices fm all the other races too, who share the same, basic mentality of SUBJECTIVISM which destroys TRUTH, truth founded necessarily upon an objective reality.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;So there u have it: the conspiracy depends, naturally, upon lies and fraud--esp. the ultimate fraud, that of fractional-reserve money &amp;amp; banking, like the Fed fraud.  But remember, this COUNTERFEITING fraud is only the practical fraud necessarily BUILT upon a complex of lies within the minds of a CORRUPT population.  THUS CRIMINALS RULE--over cowards afraid of facing truth.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;And that&amp;#39;s why Christ stood for TRUTH above all, and the only appropriate ethic for this truth is HONESTY--above moralism, Pharisaism, &amp;quot;good,&amp;quot; &amp;quot;love,&amp;quot; and mystic &amp;quot;faith.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;[--------see below for part two to above entry---------A.]</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7887438306683009692/comments/default/3766709950367338776'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7887438306683009692/comments/default/3766709950367338776'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/03/dr-leviathan-will-see-you-now.html?showComment=1269358366291#c3766709950367338776' title=''/><author><name>apollonian</name><uri>http://www.newnation.org</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/th