 I already know they are true.&lt;br /&gt;Lastly, your request to pray for Justus&amp;#39; is duly noted!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7887438306683009692/comments/default/5514994238315287066'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7887438306683009692/comments/default/5514994238315287066'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/03/dr-leviathan-will-see-you-now.html?showComment=1269352325807#c5514994238315287066' title=''/><author><name>Daniel Hewitt</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/03/dr-leviathan-will-see-you-now.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7887438306683009692' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7887438306683009692' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1255395480"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 23, 2010 at 7:52 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7821164973491071704</id><published>2010-03-23T03:18:09.857-06:00</published><updated>2010-03-23T03:18:09.857-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Stan Back got it right.&#xa;&#xa;That&amp;#39;s the transgende...</title><content type='html'>Stan Back got it right.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;That&amp;#39;s the transgendered Chris &amp;quot;Chrissy&amp;quot; Korda in the first pic.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;She&amp;#39;s a man baby!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7887438306683009692/comments/default/7821164973491071704'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165